<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming-ws2074177">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p001:m0000" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">文安王皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p001:m0006" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">寶明</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。祖<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p001:m0017" ref="yfa_tz5_3ge">韶之</persName>，吳興太守。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p001:m0026" ref="e8b_fms_9mk">曄之</persName>，太宰祭酒。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">宋世，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0003" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>為<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0006" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh">文惠太子</persName>納<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0011" ref="m9u_v4i_tk5">后</persName>，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0013" ref="fjv_3dz_w0m">桂陽賊</persName>至，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0018" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>在新亭，傳言已沒，宅復為人所抄掠，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0037" ref="ipq_o9t_wdh">文惠太子</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0042" ref="x3q_cqm_dup">竟陵王子良</persName>奉<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0048" ref="262_b8f_4ie_AA">穆后</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0051" ref="v9d_w9p_fij">庾妃</persName>及后挺身送后兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0060" ref="009_19m_qao">昺</persName>之家，事平乃出。建元元年，為南郡王妃。四年，為皇太子妃，無寵。太子為宮人製新麗衣裳及首飾，而后牀帷陳設故舊，釵鑷十餘枚。永明十一年，為皇太孫太妃。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0134" ref="iop_ybd_afm">鬱林</persName>即位，尊為皇太后，稱宣德宮。贈后<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0152" ref="e8b_fms_9mk">父</persName>金紫光祿大夫，母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0161" ref="vvf_ol4_jvc">桓氏</persName>豐安縣君。其年十二月，備法駕謁太廟。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0181" ref="w4m_9tw_147">高宗</persName>即位，出居<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0188" ref="so9_dzz_czr">鄱陽王</persName>故第，為宣德宮。永元三年，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0204" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf">梁王</persName>定京邑，迎后入宮稱制，至禪位。天監十一年，薨，年五十八。葬崇安陵。諡曰安后。兄<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-wangbaoming:p002:m0245" ref="otc_2vr_c4y">晃</persName>義興太守。</p>
</text>
